The first time you meet me, I'm not very nurturing.

967
00:38:55.280 --> 00:38:56.480
Like, he's done this a bunch.

968
00:38:56.660 --> 00:38:57.760
I feel like I'm over him.

969
00:38:57.880 --> 00:38:59.260
Oh, you're so fed up with him.

970
00:38:59.300 --> 00:39:01.100
Like, the first time you see me, I'm just—

971
00:39:01.100 --> 00:39:04.660
That look you give to camera when he's doing all of his shenanigans.

972
00:39:04.660 --> 00:39:05.180
Yeah, I got the camera look.

973
00:39:05.180 --> 00:39:05.880
I got the office.

974
00:39:05.980 --> 00:39:08.020
Yeah, you got the classic Jim to camera.

975
00:39:08.340 --> 00:39:08.660
Yeah.

976
00:39:08.660 --> 00:39:11.180
Yeah, I mean, it's definitely experience.

977
00:39:11.380 --> 00:39:16.200
But, yeah, I thought that was funny that you don't see me grow annoyed with him.

978
00:39:16.500 --> 00:39:18.640
It seems like it's a few classes in.

979
00:39:18.760 --> 00:39:19.120
Oh, my God.

980
00:39:19.220 --> 00:39:19.460
Jesus.

981
00:39:19.660 --> 00:39:20.140
Oh, God.

982
00:39:20.240 --> 00:39:20.940
He came tonight.

983
00:39:21.880 --> 00:39:27.160
Okay, so a question we always ask our folks that come on as well is, do you still get recognized

984
00:39:27.160 --> 00:39:28.500
from your role in the office?

985
