I do.

986
00:39:29.840 --> 00:39:31.700
But it's been going on for so long.

987
00:39:32.020 --> 00:39:34.140
Like, during the pandemic, I think people watched it a lot more.

988
00:39:34.180 --> 00:39:34.520
Oh, yeah.

989
00:39:34.660 --> 00:39:36.000
People binged it during the pandemic.

990
00:39:36.000 --> 00:39:40.320
Yeah, yeah, and so now, like, we've watched it so many times, you're kind of on your third

991
00:39:40.320 --> 00:39:41.480
or fourth viewing.

992
00:39:41.540 --> 00:39:46.300
I feel like I get a lot of people I've known for a few years, like kids, you know, friends,

993
00:39:46.480 --> 00:39:48.520
parents, like, oh, my God, I was rewatching it.

994
00:39:48.600 --> 00:39:49.740
I didn't realize that was you.

995
00:39:49.980 --> 00:39:51.200
Like, I get a lot of that.

996
00:39:51.340 --> 00:39:53.380
Like, people I've known, and then—

997
00:39:53.380 --> 00:39:54.860
They're connecting the dots later.

998
00:39:54.860 --> 00:39:55.140
Yeah.

999
00:39:55.240 --> 00:39:55.360
Yeah.

1000
00:39:55.380 --> 00:39:58.660
More than, like, a guy off the street, like, you know.

1001
00:39:58.780 --> 00:40:00.580
But, yeah, yeah, I get it a lot.

1002
00:40:00.800 --> 00:40:05.360
Yeah, I had that—one of my daughter's friends who, you know, I've known this kid

1003
00:40:05.360 --> 00:40:08.760
since kindergarten, her and my daughter are, like, best buddies.

1004
00:40:09.100 --> 00:40:15.380
And it was sometime around, like, sixth grade, she started watching The Office, and she's

1005
00:40:15.380 --> 00:40:18.060
been in my house countless times in sleepovers.

1006
00:40:18.100 --> 00:40:20.220
And then one day, she was like, wait a second.

1007
00:40:21.020 --> 00:40:23.420
She was like, she didn't know how to act around me one day.

1008
00:40:23.440 --> 00:40:24.540
I'm like, it's still me.

1009
00:40:25.160 --> 00:40:26.480
She made the connection.

1010
00:40:28.020 --> 00:40:32.120
Yeah, so it was kind of fun to see her realize that.

1011
00:40:32.360 --> 00:40:32.780
Yeah, yeah.

1012
00:40:33.020 --> 00:40:35.180
But are you watching it with your kids, you were saying?

1013
00:40:35.540 --> 00:40:35.820
Yeah.

1014
00:40:36.140 --> 00:40:36.680
I mean, definitely.

1015
00:40:36.820 --> 00:40:39.600
They're 11 and 14, so we're through it.

1016
00:40:39.720 --> 00:40:44.460
You know, at first, Luca—it's Luca 11, Parker 14, shout out.

1017
00:40:44.560 --> 00:40:45.760
Shout out to my kids.

1018
00:40:45.840 --> 00:40:46.440
My wife, Laura.

1019
00:40:46.920 --> 00:40:47.320
Shout out.

1020
00:40:47.480 --> 00:40:47.700
What's up, family?

1021
00:40:48.300 --> 00:40:49.140
What's up, Naughton?

1022
